            <note corresp="#d603-f2" n="2" xml:id="d603-f2-content">
                <p>Receipt of the note of the Minister of Foreign Affairs, in the terms of enclosure
                    2 and under date of Sept. 28, is reported in the Minister’s despatch No. 1656,
                    Oct. 8, received Nov. 19. (File No. 763.72/7780.)</p>
            </note>
